        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FP828, Contemporary Oblong Cup Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Deltana made Contemporary Oblong Flush Pull allows you to slide a pocket door in and out without the pull catching. For use on sliding doors, pocket doors, cabinet doors--any door where a flush pull is desired. Flush pulls are mortised into the face of the door. 4\" long by 1\" wide with a total depth of 1/2\". Available in 9 finishes with a 1/32\" thick made of solid brass base. Comes packaged with matching finish mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FP828-Specifications.gif?v=1704354679\" width=\"531\" height=\"147\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana FP828 Oblong Flush Door Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/3-1-2-inch-contemporary-oblong-flush-pull-deltana-fp223\"><b>3-1/2 Inch Contemporary Oblong Flush Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for the Deltana FP828 Oblong Cup Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Cutout Height: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Cutout Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 1/32\" Thick Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish mounting screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FP828.pdf?v=1704262231\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana FP828  Dimensions  Diagram (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "4 Inch Contemporary Oblong Flush Pull | Deltana FP828",
                "description": "4 Inch Oblong Cup Pull - Deltana FP828 - This Deltana made Contemporary Oblong Flush Pull allows you to slide a pocket door in and out without the pull catching. For use on sliding doors, pocket doors, cabinet doors--any door where a flush pull is desired. Flush pulls are mortised into the face of the door. 4 inches long by 1 inch wide with a total depth of an 1/2 inch. Available in 9 finishes with a 1/32 inch thick made of solid brass base. Comes packaged with matching finish mounting hardware.",
